# dissensus.ai redirects (Cloudflare static assets reads this file)

# /asri/ was a vendored copy of the ASRI dashboard, committed Jan 2026 and never
# refreshed. It hit the same live API as the real dashboard, so it rendered current
# risk numbers through seven-month-old code, under <title>frontend</title> and the
# retired company name. Nothing linked to it. One canonical dashboard.
/asri/*  https://asri.dissensus.ai/:splat  301
/asri    https://asri.dissensus.ai         301

